WEBVTT

00:01.795 --> 00:04.635
Okay, Taiyo. Say, "Ahh!"

00:04.801 --> 00:05.887
Hey, no…

00:07.389 --> 00:08.851
"Ahh!"

00:09.018 --> 00:10.270
Come on, that's embarrassing.

00:10.270 --> 00:11.774
That's an order!

00:12.274 --> 00:13.151
Yes, ma'am.

00:34.653 --> 00:36.532
What is this? So divine!

00:36.991 --> 00:38.661
You try some, too, Sui,

00:39.161 --> 00:40.999
Chief, Oga…

00:41.542 --> 00:43.378
we are invited guests here.

00:43.838 --> 00:45.633
Please try to restrain yourselves.

00:49.600 --> 00:50.727
Right back at you.

00:56.362 --> 00:59.452
Oh, man, such a waste to eat it!

00:59.786 --> 01:00.913
That looks good.

01:01.707 --> 01:03.001
Give me one.

01:03.001 --> 01:04.170
Denied.

01:04.170 --> 01:06.759
I'm not letting anyone have
my loving sister's bento meal.

01:07.636 --> 01:09.681
That's a creepy name for it.

01:10.182 --> 01:12.394
Face off now! Face off!

01:12.729 --> 01:15.108
Don't get hurt, all right, Grandpa?

01:16.904 --> 01:18.323
You can practice on me!

01:18.323 --> 01:20.243
Come on, bring it, Futaba!

01:20.828 --> 01:21.830
Give it your all!

01:22.373 --> 01:23.584
You're still in it!

01:27.049 --> 01:28.594
Why'd you blast me away, too?

01:35.817 --> 01:38.196
<i>Our operation
is set to be launched tomorrow,</i>

01:38.697 --> 01:41.578
<i>and we're here for a nighttime
cherry blossom viewing party.</i>

01:58.278 --> 02:07.839
MISSION: YOZAKURA FAMILY

03:16.685 --> 03:20.108
Dance, won't you dance?

03:20.610 --> 03:21.987
Let's dance.

03:22.404 --> 03:24.199
You'll dance, won't you?

03:24.534 --> 03:29.168
PLAN 22
CHERRY BLOSSOM VIEWING PARTY

03:34.178 --> 03:35.556
It's reacting?

03:36.140 --> 03:39.564
This is the Yozakura family's
sacred tree, Tennou.

03:40.190 --> 03:41.108
Ms. Keiko.

03:49.124 --> 03:53.550
Your control over your Blooming
is still weak,

03:53.550 --> 03:55.345
so it's easy to resonate with you, I see.

03:56.598 --> 03:59.604
This tree has existed
since the time of the first head.

03:59.604 --> 04:01.190
It's a mysterious cherry blossom tree

04:01.190 --> 04:04.279
with a slight amount
of someinine coursing through it.

04:04.781 --> 04:07.787
Its fragrance harmonizes
with Yozakura blood

04:07.787 --> 04:09.833
and heals the soul and body.

04:11.293 --> 04:15.845
That's why it's our tradition
to gather here before important events.

04:16.345 --> 04:17.515
Oh, really?

04:17.724 --> 04:20.061
It's effective
on all kinds of other things, too.

04:20.061 --> 04:23.025
Stiff shoulders, poor circulation,
breakouts, rheumatism.

04:23.652 --> 04:24.738
Like a hot spring?

04:25.321 --> 04:27.451
Tomorrow you'll be infiltrating.

04:27.827 --> 04:30.666
And this is how we prepare…

04:31.208 --> 04:32.670
by viewing flowers.

04:32.670 --> 04:34.339
This is the Yozakura Banquet.

04:39.057 --> 04:42.690
And so, Taiyo,
I want you to refresh your spirit, too.

04:43.776 --> 04:44.694
Ms. Keiko…

04:45.571 --> 04:46.405
don't mind if I do!

04:46.405 --> 04:48.660
Keiko's rolled omelets!

04:50.831 --> 04:52.084
Whoa!

04:53.670 --> 04:54.881
Hey, sorry--

04:58.054 --> 04:59.139
Are you all right?

05:00.183 --> 05:01.227
You!

05:01.686 --> 05:06.070
Well, well, Mr. Hoshifuru. I thought you
couldn't make it today because of work.

05:06.362 --> 05:11.038
Yes, but I finished it up early
to be here, since I wanted to see him.

05:12.792 --> 05:14.253
Hey-- Huh?

05:14.253 --> 05:15.714
Hey, Taiyo.

05:15.714 --> 05:18.929
Under this glamorous cherry blossom tree,
you're even more gorgeous.

05:20.056 --> 05:22.645
Oh, right. I didn't think
I should show up empty-handed,

05:22.645 --> 05:24.273
so I made your favorite food for you.

05:24.941 --> 05:26.862
I hope that it meets
your tongue's approval.

05:29.742 --> 05:31.412
Now then, partake.

05:36.255 --> 05:40.681
You have no idea what that contains.
You mustn't eat it, Lord Taiyo!

05:41.181 --> 05:42.309
Who are you to talk?

05:43.436 --> 05:46.025
You're Ayaka Kirisaki,
the legendary manhunter spy,

05:46.025 --> 05:50.241
ranked number one as
the "Spy You Don't Want as a Girlfriend"

05:50.241 --> 05:51.493
three years in a row!

05:51.786 --> 05:54.499
Good for you,
biggest flirt in the spy world,

05:54.499 --> 05:58.884
constantly ranked the "Most Annoying
and Creepy Spy," Tsukiyo Hoshifuru!

05:59.384 --> 06:00.763
You're so well informed.

06:01.932 --> 06:03.810
What a way to keep track of each other.

06:04.019 --> 06:05.689
How unfortunate for you!

06:05.689 --> 06:10.365
Lord Taiyo loves the omelets that I myself
pour my soul into making for him!

06:10.866 --> 06:12.536
Right, Lord Taiyo?

06:12.536 --> 06:14.248
Where'd that come from?

06:15.416 --> 06:17.003
All show and no substance.

06:17.003 --> 06:19.424
You really think you can top my omelets?

06:21.095 --> 06:26.815
Lord Taiyo, permission
to dispose of this vile stalker?

06:26.815 --> 06:31.073
Why don't you step away from my Taiyo,
you stalker maid?

06:31.073 --> 06:32.785
Hey! You guys need to cut it out--

06:33.119 --> 06:35.456
Just cut it out, you guys.

06:35.749 --> 06:36.793
Sui!

06:38.462 --> 06:41.260
Thick omelets for the win, right?

06:42.513 --> 06:43.724
Are you kidding me?

06:44.016 --> 06:46.061
Hold up, you little punks!

06:46.061 --> 06:49.694
Nothing tops Keiko's rolled omelets,
and you know it!

06:50.028 --> 06:52.658
Really, now, what a farce.

06:56.248 --> 06:57.710
Mutsumi's omelets.

06:58.294 --> 07:01.634
Come on, Taiyo,
which omelet do you want to eat?

07:02.595 --> 07:04.599
I-I…

07:27.477 --> 07:29.397
They were all delicious!

07:29.397 --> 07:30.776
Thank you for the food!

07:33.155 --> 07:34.659
Hey! Taiyo!

07:35.577 --> 07:37.706
Play strip rock-paper-scissors with us!

07:38.207 --> 07:40.754
Taiyo and Shinzo, you're up next.

07:40.754 --> 07:41.881
M-Me?

07:42.257 --> 07:45.889
All right, Taiyo,
let's strip Shinzo naked!

07:45.889 --> 07:47.518
Huh? Um…

07:48.018 --> 07:49.981
I'll serve as your referee.

07:50.356 --> 07:52.193
Hey! Hold up a sec--

07:52.611 --> 07:53.613
Whoa!

07:54.030 --> 07:55.116
What?

08:03.592 --> 08:07.683
Tomorrow is the day
that we launch the Seed-Sowing Project.

08:08.685 --> 08:10.229
And so…

08:11.733 --> 08:13.485
let's party like crazy!

08:13.987 --> 08:16.241
Let's party like crazy!

08:16.743 --> 08:18.955
Ms. Ai, let's eat sitting down, all right?

08:19.497 --> 08:21.502
Jeez, could you be more hyper?

08:21.920 --> 08:24.717
We've been carrying on like this
for the last few days.

08:24.717 --> 08:26.136
I agree.

08:26.136 --> 08:28.474
What are we going to do
if they show up to assault us?

08:29.392 --> 08:30.979
Shouldn't be a problem.

08:30.979 --> 08:35.822
I'm pretty sure that even they
wouldn't make it to this desert island.

08:36.323 --> 08:37.492
Right, Chacha?

08:37.993 --> 08:40.164
Don't talk to me, jerk.

08:44.882 --> 08:47.178
Hey, this one's still raw.

08:48.097 --> 08:49.850
Akai, would you mind?

08:52.105 --> 08:54.401
Akai, do mine, too, will you?

08:54.819 --> 08:55.821
Ow, hot!

08:56.405 --> 08:58.952
Mr. Kawashita! I will rescue you--

09:00.831 --> 09:01.749
Ms. Ai!

09:01.749 --> 09:04.004
Jeez, what do you think you're doing?

09:04.004 --> 09:05.381
Are you okay, Ai?

09:05.841 --> 09:08.220
Didn't I tell you to stay seated?

09:09.515 --> 09:12.061
You're all so cold.

09:16.445 --> 09:19.200
YOZAKURA BANQUET

09:19.200 --> 09:20.621
Excuse me.

09:20.912 --> 09:22.708
What's about to happen now?

09:23.835 --> 09:26.841
This is your first time, eh, Taiyo?

09:26.841 --> 09:28.637
It's our family tradition.

09:28.637 --> 09:29.471
What?

09:30.097 --> 09:31.433
YOZAKURA BANQUET

09:32.645 --> 09:33.772
What's going on?

09:34.774 --> 09:38.907
And now, ladies and gentlemen, please
direct your attention towards the stage.

09:40.326 --> 09:41.244
Keiko!

09:41.244 --> 09:43.165
Ohh! Mutsumi!

09:43.165 --> 09:44.167
Ke-Ke-Keiko!

09:44.167 --> 09:49.094
Magical Hop…

09:49.094 --> 09:52.058
Destroy!

09:52.350 --> 09:53.937
Big Sis Shion?

09:57.861 --> 10:01.201
My ruby-red eyes are on the alert

10:01.201 --> 10:03.998
No evil deed can escape me

10:03.998 --> 10:06.546
I can even make lonely kids in tears

10:06.546 --> 10:09.467
Switch to a sweet smile

10:09.467 --> 10:11.931
No mercy for the bad guys

10:11.931 --> 10:12.933
Watch my acclaimed

10:12.933 --> 10:15.229
Hind-leg kick explode!

10:15.229 --> 10:17.818
To protect peace all over the world

10:17.818 --> 10:20.574
I'll come running anytime, anywhere

10:20.574 --> 10:21.993
No use trying to flee me

10:21.993 --> 10:23.663
With just one hop

10:23.663 --> 10:25.416
I can catch up and arrest you

10:25.416 --> 10:29.048
Magical Hop!

10:29.048 --> 10:32.054
-Mutsumi!
-Keiko!

10:36.271 --> 10:42.701
I'll seize all of your hearts
in this adorable form

10:42.701 --> 10:47.418
I'm cute, but inside me,
the flames of dreams and justice burn!

10:47.418 --> 10:53.723
These long ears of mine
won't miss any evil deeds

10:53.723 --> 10:56.729
Love and courage
will give my tail a charge!

10:56.729 --> 10:58.398
Magical Hop!

10:58.691 --> 11:00.904
Magical Hop!

11:00.904 --> 11:02.490
Destroy

11:06.999 --> 11:08.545
Just kill me.

11:08.545 --> 11:12.218
Thanks, Bis Sis Shion,
for indulging me like this!

11:17.186 --> 11:21.152
Thank you for being born
into this world, Mutsumi!

11:21.152 --> 11:24.743
I don't have a single regret in my life.

11:28.125 --> 11:29.962
You have a great voice, Shion.

11:30.797 --> 11:33.427
Shut up. It's your turn next.

11:34.304 --> 11:35.765
But that was a compliment.

11:35.765 --> 11:36.349
KILL

11:36.517 --> 11:38.730
SHIN

11:39.355 --> 11:40.190
<i>Who's that?</i>

11:40.984 --> 11:42.696
All right, please listen up.

11:42.696 --> 11:45.910
Music and lyrics by me.
"Scarlet Cherry Blossom."

11:47.371 --> 11:50.336
Scarlet!

11:51.631 --> 11:54.135
Cherry blossom!

11:54.678 --> 11:56.222
Dyed in the color of blood!

11:56.222 --> 11:59.187
PLEASE WAIT A MOMENT

11:59.437 --> 12:00.732
Yay! Good for you!

12:00.732 --> 12:03.153
Seriously, music's
the one thing you have good taste in!

12:30.834 --> 12:34.257
KILL

12:41.981 --> 12:46.991
MISSION: YOZAKURA FAMILY

12:48.249 --> 12:53.003
MISSION: YOZAKURA FAMILY

12:53.003 --> 12:55.967
YOZAKURA BANQUET

12:56.301 --> 12:58.723
All right, I think it's time

12:58.723 --> 13:01.394
to start double-checking
the details of our operation tomorrow.

13:01.478 --> 13:04.943
YOZAKURA FRONT LINES TRIP HANDOUTS
Everyone, please take a look
at your handouts.

13:05.444 --> 13:07.156
YOZAKURA FRONT LINES HANDOUTS
<i>Is this a field trip or what?</i>

13:07.490 --> 13:10.496
Tomorrow's mission,
Yozakura Front Lines, has three goals.

13:11.331 --> 13:15.924
First, to retrieve every ounce of
the Hazakura in Tanpopo's possession

13:15.924 --> 13:20.015
and to arrest Kawashita,
the Tanpopo leader and mastermind.

13:20.307 --> 13:24.482
This is also a request
by the MPD and the Spy Association.

13:24.482 --> 13:26.152
The main objective will be to eliminate

13:26.152 --> 13:28.240
all organizations
targeting the Yozakura family.

13:28.783 --> 13:31.747
Second, to liberate the test subjects,

13:31.747 --> 13:35.129
meaning the rescue of those being held
against their will at the hideout

13:35.129 --> 13:37.424
to be subjected to Hazakura experiments.

13:37.424 --> 13:40.849
As requested by Hinagiku, we'll be
coordinating our strategies for this.

13:40.849 --> 13:42.727
And finally, third…

13:43.228 --> 13:45.942
to unmask the truth about Momo Yozakura.

13:46.401 --> 13:49.240
Father's movements are the one thing
we've been unable to predict,

13:49.240 --> 13:51.662
so we can't incorporate them
into our plan.

13:52.121 --> 13:53.875
To prepare for unforeseen circumstances,

13:54.292 --> 13:57.632
I ask you to each follow the plan
and give it your all.

13:58.466 --> 14:01.389
One more thing!
Please take your trash home with you!

14:01.389 --> 14:04.395
Is that clear? Your mission
isn't over until you get home!

14:04.395 --> 14:05.982
-Right!
-Right!

14:05.982 --> 14:08.236
<i>Yeah. It's a field trip, all right.</i>

14:08.779 --> 14:10.073
<i>Tomorrow's the day.</i>

14:15.877 --> 14:17.171
All right, Futaba!

14:17.463 --> 14:19.425
Let's drink to boost our morale!

14:19.425 --> 14:21.597
You know that I can't drink.

14:29.947 --> 14:30.990
Why?

14:33.746 --> 14:34.665
<i>A grave?</i>

14:35.875 --> 14:38.881
It's the ninth head's… my mother's.

14:40.133 --> 14:41.637
Not that there's a body in there.

14:41.887 --> 14:43.599
<i>Mutsumi's mom…</i>

14:44.225 --> 14:46.647
She was presumed
to have vanished that day,

14:46.647 --> 14:53.451
but the rapid strides made in the Hazakura
studies point to a certain possibility…

14:55.957 --> 14:59.548
that Tanpopo has my mother's body.

15:00.842 --> 15:04.432
The blood, flesh, and heart
of the Yozakura head…

15:05.308 --> 15:10.068
without research materials of that scope,
they never could have come this far.

15:11.989 --> 15:16.289
This is the fourth mission,
shared by only you and me.

15:16.874 --> 15:21.424
We're going to recover my mother's body
without the other siblings catching on

15:21.800 --> 15:26.350
and lay her to rest here,
on the Yozakura land where she was born.

15:30.317 --> 15:31.570
But why…

15:31.987 --> 15:35.035
would you give
such an important mission to me?

15:37.791 --> 15:39.544
Don't flatter yourself.

15:39.544 --> 15:41.965
All I did was ask him why!

15:44.971 --> 15:47.685
There's no need to risk
making our siblings suffer

15:47.685 --> 15:50.775
by showing them such a horrendous reality.

15:51.359 --> 15:55.868
As the eldest child,
only I should have to shoulder that load.

15:56.410 --> 15:59.793
I shared it with you,
an outsider, just for insurance.

16:01.505 --> 16:03.174
Don't tell Mutsumi, either.

16:03.174 --> 16:05.888
This is a top-secret mission
for you and me only.

16:06.264 --> 16:07.559
And if I were to--

16:08.476 --> 16:10.731
What are you two doing alone?

16:14.906 --> 16:16.827
All right, come on, Kyoichiro!

16:16.827 --> 16:18.288
Time for sumo!

16:19.206 --> 16:22.337
Gramps, you made Futaba drink, didn't you?

16:27.891 --> 16:28.851
Mutsumi.

16:31.982 --> 16:35.030
Really, Big Bro and Big Sis
can be so rough with others!

16:36.324 --> 16:38.537
There's still some food left.

16:38.537 --> 16:39.623
Want to head back?

16:39.623 --> 16:41.543
Yeah, good idea.

16:42.461 --> 16:43.631
Good luck, okay?

16:43.631 --> 16:44.465
What?

16:45.718 --> 16:48.599
I won't ask what you were talking about,

16:48.599 --> 16:50.519
but I'll always,
always be rooting for you.

16:53.984 --> 16:55.153
Hey, thanks…

16:55.529 --> 16:56.364
Mutsumi.

17:05.351 --> 17:09.056
THE NEXT MORNING
5:30 AM

17:13.816 --> 17:18.491
MISSION: YOZAKURA FRONT LINES BEGINS

17:22.457 --> 17:24.086
Oh, man.

17:24.086 --> 17:28.303
Karaoke after all that
really took a toll on me.

17:28.303 --> 17:30.140
I must be getting old.

17:30.432 --> 17:31.768
Intruders detected!

17:31.768 --> 17:32.603
Huh?

17:35.943 --> 17:40.285
Weapons, armor, transmitters,
handkerchiefs, tissues, snacks.

17:41.037 --> 17:43.041
You've all packed all that, right?

17:47.174 --> 17:48.217
SUMOMO PLUM (SKY MODE)
YOZAKURA FAMILY CAR

17:48.217 --> 17:51.933
No, no, I can't! I'm so scared!

17:51.933 --> 17:54.689
You're gonna be fine, Big Bro Shinzo!

17:55.106 --> 17:57.695
We will watch over
and protect Lady Mutsumi!

17:58.196 --> 18:00.408
Taiyo, be careful, okay?

18:00.785 --> 18:02.079
Thanks, Mutsumi!

18:02.580 --> 18:03.749
What about your Big Bro?

18:03.999 --> 18:06.922
If you were to die,
we'd all be going down with you.

18:09.301 --> 18:11.682
All right, then, off you go!

18:11.682 --> 18:13.351
My darling grandchildren!

18:14.729 --> 18:17.192
Make sure you're home by dinner!

18:20.616 --> 18:23.914
E.T.A. to the surface, within one minute.

18:24.373 --> 18:28.256
Oh, man. So they've found us after all.

18:28.256 --> 18:29.884
How'd our cover get blown?

18:30.176 --> 18:31.303
It was Hakuja.

18:34.059 --> 18:39.988
Hakuja gave Taiyo Asano information
about this hideout on the Gerbera…

18:40.906 --> 18:46.333
by sending him coded messages too fast to
be detected without someinine enhancement.

18:47.754 --> 18:52.972
Mr. Yozakura, why didn't you ever
clue me in about something that crucial?

18:52.972 --> 18:54.517
You never asked me.

18:54.517 --> 18:56.312
Hmm, I see.

18:56.813 --> 18:58.191
Then, no wonder.

18:58.525 --> 19:02.324
I wonder if Ms. Hakuja
didn't like us anymore.

19:02.825 --> 19:05.915
No. She must have had her reasons.

19:06.415 --> 19:09.129
Yeah, since our leader's
not exactly popular.

19:09.379 --> 19:12.803
After all the effort
I've put in for this world.

19:12.803 --> 19:14.097
So why?

19:15.099 --> 19:18.064
They've entered
the hideout's wireless range.

19:18.565 --> 19:20.736
Although the enemy
will be able to detect them,

19:20.736 --> 19:24.034
it also means that we can access
their maps and other inside info.

19:24.827 --> 19:30.088
It's a 1,000-meter-deep crater used
as a base by the former Imperial Army

19:30.088 --> 19:32.510
officially said to have been
obliterated during the war.

19:33.010 --> 19:34.847
The nerve center
has the tightest security,

19:34.847 --> 19:37.352
and that's where you'll likely find
our target, Kawashita.

19:37.352 --> 19:39.983
You'll be heading there
and charging in through the entrance,

19:39.983 --> 19:41.945
using Goliath to ram through the shutters.

19:41.945 --> 19:42.905
Huh?

19:43.991 --> 19:45.870
Access denied.

19:46.161 --> 19:48.291
They're updating their system
at warp speed.

19:49.459 --> 19:51.255
Impressive as always, Chacha.

19:52.340 --> 19:54.554
Huh? Where's Akai?

19:54.554 --> 19:56.766
She took off for the shutters just now.

19:56.766 --> 19:59.021
She was like,
"I'm going to kill them all!"

19:59.313 --> 20:01.358
What, seriously?

20:01.358 --> 20:02.987
That gives me goosebumps!

20:07.705 --> 20:10.376
Well, we don't have to worry about her.

20:10.961 --> 20:14.677
After all, she's the most devastating
monster we have in Nijibana.

20:15.303 --> 20:17.265
AKAI TANPOPO EXECUTIVE "NIJIBANA"
HAZAKURA EFFICIENCY 512%
(NUMBER 1 IN THE NIJIBANA)

20:24.363 --> 20:25.574
Hand of the Fire God!

20:26.576 --> 20:28.454
Toss me already, Shinzo.

20:28.454 --> 20:30.668
You're going to get torched, Big Sis!

20:30.668 --> 20:32.045
As if I care.

20:32.045 --> 20:33.422
Who should lead the charge but…

20:33.799 --> 20:34.842
the eldest daughter?

20:40.353 --> 20:41.188
Hey.

20:41.648 --> 20:42.608
Cherry Blossom Drain!

20:43.401 --> 20:45.363
I'm going to let myself in, all right?

20:52.920 --> 20:56.720
Who knew she'd counter that?

20:59.224 --> 21:01.103
<i>Shutter breach confirmed.</i>

21:04.986 --> 21:07.867
We're in. Everyone,
launch your respective operations.

21:08.535 --> 21:09.871
Enemy attack!

21:21.268 --> 21:23.940
Kengo and Nanao, rescue the test subjects.

21:23.940 --> 21:27.531
Kyoichiro, Shinzo, Taiyo,
keep moving towards the nerve center.

21:27.990 --> 21:29.242
-Roger that!
-Roger that!

21:41.976 --> 21:43.187
<i>Futaba here.</i>

21:43.187 --> 21:45.984
<i>As planned,
the front entrance has been secured.</i>

21:46.151 --> 21:49.449
Everyone, get yourselves ready
as you surround the island.

21:49.449 --> 21:51.245
Out of my way, you miserable cur!

21:53.917 --> 21:55.629
Goliath, ball!

22:06.233 --> 22:10.199
For spies, you sure are a violent bunch.

22:10.491 --> 22:14.207
Goliath, I'm counting on you to take care
of the scrubs in the other routes.

22:15.586 --> 22:18.090
I'll be taking on this one myself.

22:18.758 --> 22:20.094
Oh?

23:50.984 --> 23:55.994
NEXT TIME
EASTERLY WIND / WEAPON
